On the one hand, I agree with you. So what? If it's almost Lojban, who's to
say the differences are not just a mistake, handled through context and
further explanation.
On the other hand, Lojban may be prescribed, but it's not proscribed (i.e.,
denounced, forbidden, condemned, prohibited).

stevo

